Z||000000||kinboyatuwo||01-25-2001||12:47 PM||||So it finally happened.  Last night on the way gome from the shop and finally getting the throttle cable fixed (actually jurry riged)now i can get wide open throttle.  The car was running nice and fast, too fast, ooopppps<P>came around the corner and touched the throttle and bam, he got me<BR>radar detector had no chance, it was screaming, just toooooooooo late.<P><BR>97 km in a 50<BR>he knocked it to 85 in a 50 and was pretty cool, still 4 points (he said 3 but i found out 4, sh!t)<P>So a lesson to me........i will post later can't give up the speed have to think of a different lesson!<P>------------------<BR>"Friends don't let friends drive four doors."||||reg||8
