Z||000007||Standard||01-26-2001||05:10 AM||||I used to always speed, but I've settled down big time now.  I get my kicks from rowin' through the gears taking off from stoplights.. even if traffic is moving at 80-85 mph in the left lane I'd rather stay in the right lane at my 5mph over, max.  2 speeding tickets will do that to ya'... I haven't gotten a ticket for well over a year now, and one of the speeding tickets is off my record.  I think I'm gonna try to keep it that way... I definatly plan on saving it for the track  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||
