Z||000012||Joe4x4||01-27-2001||12:32 PM||||OK got a trick you can try....<P>when you pay the ticket (by mail) pay it $5 more, <BR>the police will send you a refund for $5<BR>DO NOT CASH IT !!!<P>If you do not cash the refund check the computer will not inform the ins. co.<P>so this way no points. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>I have not tried this yet .<BR>Waiting for my next ticket.<P>------------------<BR>Fiero got fire<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/exp.gif">          <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/animated_cat.gif"> ||||reg||1
