Z||000015||kinboyatuwo||01-29-2001||01:42 PM||||Not sure of the brand of the radar detector.  Has always worked till that day!  Not sure what was wrongI have integrated it into the car.  2 Led's for the lights and ran the on/off switch to the dash.  The warning sound is input to my fron driver side speaker.  You can then hear it if the music is cranked.<P>Oh well it has saved me already, guess they are not fool proof.<P>------------------<BR>"Friends don't let friends drive four doors."||||reg||3
